<section class="card"><h2 class="card-h">Restore</h2><ol class="small"><li>Download the ZIP and keep a copy of the current <code>data/</code> folder.</li><li>Replace <code>data/app.sqlite</code> (and <code>data/.secret</code>) with the ones in the ZIP.</li><li>Replace <code>uploads/</code> with the ZIP's <code>uploads/</code>.</li><li>Delete <code>data/app.sqlite-wal</code> and <code>-shm</code> if present.</li></ol><p class="small muted">Store backups off-server too (download weekly) — Hostinger's own backups are a second safety net.</p></section>
